# Growing Rites of Itlimoc: "At the beginning of your end step, if you control four or more creatures, transform it." Turn 1: Bot1 casts Memnite and two
# Ornithopters, then Rites, whose enters trigger takes the Ornithopter on top of the library, and casts it: four creatures. At the beginning of the end step the
# trigger goes on the stack and transforms it (CR 701.27a) into Itlimoc, Cradle of the Sun, a land that is no longer an enchantment (CR 712.8e).
# Itlimoc taps for {G} (turn 3) or for {G} for each creature, counted as the ability is activated (turn 5, four creatures: {G}{G}{G}{G}).

